message: "If you use this software or analytical framework, please cite the associated publication and this repository."
title: "Anatomy-referenced transcriptomic fidelity analysis for human dermal papilla cell-state recovery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gu"
    given-names: "Mingbao"
  - family-names: "Yi"
    given-names: "Chenggang"
